{
    "title": "BitLife Cats - CatLife",
    "description": "What would it be like to live life as a cat?\r\n\r\nSay hello to CatLife, the <b>NEWEST</b> addicting text-based life simulation game from the creators of BitLife!\r\n\r\nWill you be a sassy, independent stray kitty, a lovable smitten kitten, or the companion to a cat lady who\u2019s a little bit crazy in this interactive storytelling life sim game? Your story is <i>YOURS</i> to unfold as you interact with <b>HUNDREDS</b> of scenarios on your journey to become the sweetest (or <b>BADDEST</b>) kitty in town. This addictive game will have you coming back for more\u2013no two CatLife lives are the same!\r\n\r\nThere are <b>SO</b> many breeds to choose from! Play as a Persian, Himalayan, Maine coon, Siamese, calico, sphynx, and <b><i>MUCH MORE</i></b>!\r\n\r\n\u2b06\ufe0f Climb to the <b>TOP</b> of the animal hierarchy. Show everyone you\u2019re the coolest cat around, and <b>SCHOOL</b> everyone on why cats are better than dogs!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe0 Where will you live? Choose one of <b>FOUR</b> unique habitats as the starting point for your cat\u2019s story: a household, a shelter, a pet store, or a stray cat on the streets.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf97\ufe0f <b>COLLECT</b> achievements and ribbons to commemorate the stories you\u2019ve lived!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude3b Introducing our <b><i>ALL-NEW</i></b> kennel feature! Send kittens to your friends!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc36 <b>INTERACT</b> with other animals! Will you continue the feud between cats and dogs, or will you be a paw-some pal?\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc3e Got a special kitty in your life? Use our <b>custom character</b> feature to recreate your precious pet and live out their virtual life!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude40 What\u2019s that wet dog smell?! Become the scent collector as you add as many smells to your scent database as possible!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude08 Don\u2019t be idle! Work your way through <b>DOZENS</b> of scenarios that\u2019ll put you at the top of the food chain! Show other animals around you that you don\u2019t play games.\r\n\r\nThe possibilities are <b><i>ENDLESS</i></b>! Your choices determine your fate. Start your CatLife journey ASAP and see how your sims\u2019 stories unfold!",
    "descriptionHTML": "What would it be like to live life as a cat?<br><br>Say hello to CatLife, the <b>NEWEST</b> addicting text-based life simulation game from the creators of BitLife!<br><br>Will you be a sassy, independent stray kitty, a lovable smitten kitten, or the companion to a cat lady who\u2019s a little bit crazy in this interactive storytelling life sim game? Your story is <i>YOURS</i> to unfold as you interact with <b>HUNDREDS</b> of scenarios on your journey to become the sweetest (or <b>BADDEST</b>) kitty in town. This addictive game will have you coming back for more\u2013no two CatLife lives are the same!<br><br>There are <b>SO</b> many breeds to choose from! Play as a Persian, Himalayan, Maine coon, Siamese, calico, sphynx, and <b><i>MUCH MORE</i></b>!<br><br>\u2b06\ufe0f Climb to the <b>TOP</b> of the animal hierarchy. Show everyone you\u2019re the coolest cat around, and <b>SCHOOL</b> everyone on why cats are better than dogs!<br><br>\ud83c\udfe0 Where will you live? Choose one of <b>FOUR</b> unique habitats as the starting point for your cat\u2019s story: a household, a shelter, a pet store, or a stray cat on the streets.<br><br>\ud83c\udf97\ufe0f <b>COLLECT</b> achievements and ribbons to commemorate the stories you\u2019ve lived!<br><br>\ud83d\ude3b Introducing our <b><i>ALL-NEW</i></b> kennel feature! Send kittens to your friends!<br><br>\ud83d\udc36 <b>INTERACT</b> with other animals! Will you continue the feud between cats and dogs, or will you be a paw-some pal?<br><br>\ud83d\udc3e Got a special kitty in your life? Use our <b>custom character</b> feature to recreate your precious pet and live out their virtual life!<br><br>\ud83d\ude40 What\u2019s that wet dog smell?! Become the scent collector as you add as many smells to your scent database as possible!<br><br>\ud83d\ude08 Don\u2019t be idle! Work your way through <b>DOZENS</b> of scenarios that\u2019ll put you at the top of the food chain! Show other animals around you that you don\u2019t play games.<br><br>The possibilities are <b><i>ENDLESS</i></b>! Your choices determine your fate. Start your CatLife journey ASAP and see how your sims\u2019 stories unfold!",
